Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,November 11th?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a special day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know. 11-11. Make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure I'm gonna be busy around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy that day, and it's\Nsomething that I can't get out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to Yaniko Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we've rehearsed enough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe she was\Nactually worried about her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Yani Neko has a soft side too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I made this stuffed Yani\Nas a present for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I used some of her real hair, which\Nmade it look like she has a twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywho, I wonder why\NYaniko isn't here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me nobody thought\Nto invite her to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now wouldn't that just be a hoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall into можно BE HOW!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Got these words in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They died, not Durham!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall into them! Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,fall into normal destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:03:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's over, if it's over, if it's\Nover, I'll just be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's over, I'll just be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,3401!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,3401!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,3401!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is Kaoruko here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoruko, her first name? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you freaking out so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know Kaoruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.50,0:03:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even held\Nhands with a guy before!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She is such a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought her panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's even doing it with this guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Doggy style. Shower sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,With cuddling after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They had a curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my penny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.08,0:04:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a traitor! What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the mix-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This jackass here is my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, the name's Shunran.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.99,0:04:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how\Nmuch I hate you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.90,0:04:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what? Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're siblings then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured it was that,\Nto be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's no way that you would\Nhave a boyfriend, right, Kansai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:04:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't gonna let you trick me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the truth is,\Nwe're only half siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's incest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.44,0:05:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Forbidden love? Quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you he's lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nishi, do you want another drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you can have some of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It tastes better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you guys leave her alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone's going to get\Nher another drink, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.40,0:05:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You all are sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to step away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go find the powder room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.46,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't leave us, Nishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you so much, Nishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times are you\Ngoing to say that to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just pretend I didn't hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna smell like smoke. Huh? Nishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you went to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, well, I just\Nwanted to sober up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, so did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chilly out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nishi, I wanted to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really mature and\Nyou're considerate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're also graceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm none of those things, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's crazy talk. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.16,0:06:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I could never be\Nthe organizer for a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not really good at talking\Nto people like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the only reason I'm the organizer\Nis because I finished my thesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not that good\Nat socializing either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a pervert alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Never a dull moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna head back inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The pervert is burnt to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:06:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanni's the downtown pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you cooking inside a volcano or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When you make a bonfire,\Nyou gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you part fireman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be burnt to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hang on, Nishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you normally act like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say it's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name isn't Nishi, it's Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.70,0:07:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.79,0:07:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I love this sight of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that up until now, you were\Nso perfect it was hard to approach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that I've seen this, I really,\NI really want you to be my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kansai, give me a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.74,0:07:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you just go away? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You smoke even though you're\Nstill a college student?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, now I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I smoke too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:08:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just promise me you won't tell\Nanyone else about this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite a choice\Nof brand you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I guess that's that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So then we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you keep up the\Nact? It's definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,not easy give me a\Ncigarette chain smoker cat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.74,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The first wind of spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That was three full days\Nworth of work! Shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind just blew away\Nmy entire manuscript!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your manuscript?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say, you really\Nsaved me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't shown up right then, I\Nfor sure wouldn't have made my deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.70,0:09:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it happened, because now I get\Nto visit a professional's workplace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Time really does fly, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a year ago, and we\Nblink and it's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a pretty eventful year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you're a published author,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you were still kind enough to give\Nadvice to an amateur writer like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.24,0:09:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You look up to her way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course I look up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuro makes a living doing\Nsomething that she loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an inspiration to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that why you're working\Nas her assistant now, Yani?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never actually read Tatsurou's manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd read it at least once so\Nyou'd remember the character's hair color.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, your own assistant hasn't\Neven read your books before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just not acceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As a creator, that lack of awareness is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you even read Mankasu's manga before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I bought all of them, but I'm\Njust saving them to read another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.97,0:10:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.89,0:10:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she seriously still believe in Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not the type to do\Nsomething all cute like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just a prank?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you want to bet she asked\Nfor cigarettes or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, she's the one who wanted to\Nhave this Christmas drinking party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A nice smoking area for\NChristmas would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.82,0:11:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You smoke with or without a smoking area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's not something\Nyou can put in a stocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she wrote more on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and smoking with my friends\Nin the sun would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that made me kind of emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew she had feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at us doing the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't played in\Nsnow since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.98,0:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sake and snow, my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is super cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be angry if we\Ndid this again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the cold making these drinks stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't blame the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let a girl live a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drink to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking out the trash is a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the smoking area made of snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow sculptures?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're so elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna rescue us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very sure if I keep drinking at this\Npace, I'll be trashed before New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pass out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have to go to the shrine tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who falls asleep loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't really taste like sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone falls asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,then they have to shove their\Nunderwear in the landlord's mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have to stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you would love that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We seriously can't fall asleep now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kinda sleepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ch-Chain Smoker Cat,\NCh-Chain Smoker Cat, Cat, Cat
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.52,0:14:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ch-Chain Smoker, Chain Smoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the annual New Year's\Nmochi pounding begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yani Nickel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pound it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You pour water on the\Nmochi and knead it! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.06,0:14:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand the landlord\Nbeing all excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but what's with Yani being so fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she got cigarettes his payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too early in the\Nmorning to be doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Mochi Pound!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And hurt this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Been a while since I've shown\Noff my high-speed Mochi Pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm a little rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.34,0:14:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Yani Neko go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have expected that from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it cools down, we'll shape it. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I getting red bean paste in these ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those are going\Nto be the Mugwort mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that Mugwort is said to\Nward off evil spirits and misfortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as some call it, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys think this mochi kind\Nof looks like Yanni's hair color?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.56,0:15:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It might start smelling like cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's fire this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanni's echo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, oh, oh, it was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, that was my\Nfirst dream of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It had bad omen written all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to keep sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you wake up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, it's time to pound some mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for our building's annual New\NYear's Mochi Pounding, Yani Neko! Nya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pound it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to pour water on the\Nmochi and knead it. Got it? Nya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand the landlord\Nbeing all excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but what's with Yani being so fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's paying her in\Na bunch of cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too early in the\Nmorning to be doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get it done, Yani Neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They said it was cigarette poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor thing was still so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, a cigarette got mixed\Ninto the mochi he was making.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, it's time to pound some mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I in a time loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to pound some mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.44,0:17:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pound the mojiii.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why it's happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but I keep repeating the day\Nof the mojibounding and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Amigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone dies every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Each day starts off the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What pounds the mojii?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to escape\Nfrom this time loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,if I can just finish this mochi-pounding\Npeacefully without anyone dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The weather is awesome for New Year's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.78,0:18:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect for making mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The landlord seems a\Nlittle bit sad, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So when do we get to eat this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever they got close to the\Nmortar, a fatal accident would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to do something crazy\Nenough to keep them all away from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go with balls out,\Ncouple with the mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That bass flopped around like\Na fizz just out of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They should keep everyone away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the cannon sticks are kicking in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:19:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yani, don't touch it, it's giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yani, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's all stripes and no balls! It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was both soft and\Nhard at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The loop didn't start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Has it ended?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one that knows\Nabout this loop of fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Otani, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We just received a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come with us to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:19:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd go get some\NAwachi Island burgers today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just relax a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Relaxing was before eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And unless you plan on freezing\Nto death, we need more kerosene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit lollygagging!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, that's such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off, you dung beetle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, for crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffic on a holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll tear all\Nthese people a new one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See how much Mom loves traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure is loud with her love. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,ever since you started living in that\Napartment, you've been acting more like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that back or a whoopperass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouths!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, we haven't moved\Nan inch and I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your homemade Awaji Eileen burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.22,0:20:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing better than being at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize you're the\None who wanted to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoruko, did you put on a\Nfew pounds over the holidays?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my old maternity clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want them, Shunran?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you do kind of have\Na big butt, though, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.86,0:21:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wear those clothes backwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the part that's for the belly\Nwill fit over your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more burgers if\Nyou want. No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a cow, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After we eat, it's family time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we all play a board game\Ntogether and watch Shinkie Geckie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, we haven't been back home in a\Ngood while, so Mom's all needy, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I have an idea. You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been working on my beatboxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a rat sass about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if you lose, that means\Nyou gotta stay longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:21:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:21:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this going!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.47,0:22:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll dump them shit, darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.14,0:22:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this goddamn house!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.88,0:22:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Boom, boom, hello, I'm Toronyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.98,0:22:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiko no yukamu
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.18,0:22:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Today in the region Obu shi no\Nichi da wa ni Soto ni zaai yoi Nee,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.94,0:22:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,isu mo doori no hito Koko\Norde kewa Koko orde kewa Sato
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bata ni takia, Udo kama shiito\Nwa Kami sugi tat Gam no aji so
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.62,0:24:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.12,0:24:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
